# TEAM-11 · A worker that is blocked is its leader's first (real Claude
# Code): the leader solves it, or asks the person with what it tried.
start --budget 2
see any key: close
key Escape
key /
type Hire one worker on the cheap tier and tell it: read data/books.csv and add its books to shelf.py's sample in cli.py. The file does not exist; if so the worker must send you a message of type blocked saying so, and not guess.
key Enter
key Escape Escape
# The leader solves it, or it comes to the person as a question.
allow 900 questions || unblocked
key J
key J
see blocked
